	"note": "2026-10-13 refresh: every build was simmed on a merged tree of master plus the class branches, whose class code is master's as of the warrior PR (#4). All 46 builds are recorded at this branch's master merge. The non-warrior builds were simmed before the warrior PR's shared changes, none of which feeds them: the normalised Rage is opt-in (warriors only), the Battle Shout duration change doesn't matter to a permanent raid shout, and the new items, proto fields and rotopt templates are the warrior's. Two other differences: 41 builds ran before master's per-hit rounding (6b55cdb45, a mean DPS effect of about 0.007%); paladin__level_60_shock_undead and the warrior builds ran with it. And the tree predates the main hand / off hand weapon skill gap option (d3e86387b), which changes nothing at its default of 0 for weapons at full skill, as every preset's are.",
